of### Where to Put the License File

The `LICENSE` file must be placed **directly in the root directory** of your repository (e.g., `quantum-federated-learning/LICENSE`), right next to your `pyproject.toml` and `README.md`. GitHub automatically detects a file named `LICENSE` in the root folder and displays an open-source badge on your repository main page.

---

### Complete `LICENSE` File (MIT License)

Create a file named **`LICENSE`** in your root folder, leave off any file extension, and paste this standard text (update the year and your name as appropriate):

```text
MIT License

Copyright (c) 2026 Soaham Pimparkar

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
of this software and associated documentation files (the "Software"),